---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { examples } from '../showcases/engine-contract/content';
---
<section class="engine-contract-showcase wrap" id="saved-engine-translations" aria-labelledby="engine-contract-title" data-engine-contract>
  <div class="contract-intro">
    <div><p class="contract-eyebrow">Three adapters, inspected</p><h2 id="engine-contract-title">Different messages.<br /><em>A familiar conversation.</em></h2></div>
    <p>A reply, a tool at work, an answer. Each runtime describes those moments differently. These saved translations show how they become readable chat events. The engines share event names; their fields and capabilities still differ.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="contract-scope"><span aria-hidden="true"></span>Saved offline translation · synthetic input · no model or tool runs here.</p>
  <fieldset class="contract-picker">
    <legend>Choose a saved translation to inspect</legend>
    <div>{examples.map(example => <label><input type="radio" id={`contract-${example.id}`} name="engine-contract-choice" value={example.id} checked={example.id === 'codex'} /><span><strong>{example.name}</strong><small>{example.upstream}</small></span></label>)}</div>
  </fieldset>
  <div class="contract-views">
    {examples.map(example => <article class="contract-view" data-engine={example.id} aria-labelledby={`contract-${example.id}-title`}>
      <header class="contract-view-header"><p>{example.name} <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> {example.upstream}</p><h3 id={`contract-${example.id}-title`}>{example.title}</h3><p>{example.description}</p></header>
      <div class="contract-translation">
        <div class="contract-source"><p class="contract-column-label">What the adapter receives</p><ol>{example.steps.map((step,index) => <li><span>0{index + 1}</span><p>{step.input}</p></li>)}</ol></div>
        <div class="contract-chat"><p class="contract-column-label">What the chat can show <span>Saved output</span></p><ol>{example.steps.map(step => <li class:list={['contract-chat-event',`contract-${step.kind}`]}><div><code>{step.kind}</code><strong>{step.title}</strong></div><pre>{step.value}</pre></li>)}</ol><p class="contract-command-note">The sample command is text in the fixture. It is never executed.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="contract-focus"><div><p class="contract-eyebrow">The useful difference</p><h4>{example.focusTitle}</h4><p>{example.focus}</p></div><ol aria-label={`${example.name} translation detail`}>{example.focusRows.map(row => <li><span>{row.input}</span><strong>{row.output}</strong></li>)}</ol></div>
      <p class="contract-boundary">{example.boundary}</p>
      <details class="contract-details"><summary>Inspect the saved input and output <Icon name="plus" /></summary><div><p>Selected records from this offline capture. Empty output means no event was emitted. The receipt defines the field selection; retained values are unchanged. Any <code>/tmp/fixture-workspace</code> path is synthetic.</p><pre tabindex="0" aria-label={`${example.name} selected saved records`}>{JSON.stringify(example.evidence.records,null,2)}</pre></div></details>
    </article>)}
  </div>
  <details class="contract-details contract-evidence"><summary>Source versions and what was checked <Icon name="plus" /></summary><div>
    <p>On 15 October 2026, unchanged source code translated these new synthetic inputs offline. Separately, all 75 focused original tests passed: Claude 13, Codex 35 and OpenCode 27. Replaying the captures produced identical saved output.</p>
    <ul>{examples.map(example => <li><strong>{example.name}</strong><code>{example.evidence.revision}</code></li>)}</ul>
    <p>These checks establish the saved mappings shown here. They do not establish live inference, HTTP/SSE delivery or full client compatibility. The engines share an event vocabulary; optional fields and capabilities differ. Selecting an engine does not transfer conversation state.</p>
    <p>Claude uses mocked SDK transport and the source’s unit-harness branch. Its translation code is unchanged. Cost, token, timing and context fields are omitted from this exhibit; it makes no performance comparison.</p>
    <a href="/media/engine-contract/receipt.json">Read the concise source receipt <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a>
  </div></details>
</section>
<style>
.engine-contract-showcase{padding-block:42px 48px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);scroll-margin-top:24px}.contract-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr 1fr;gap:32px 54px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:24px}.contract-eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:650;color:var(--rust);margin-bottom:12px}.contract-intro h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4.2vw,4rem);line-height:1.1}.contract-intro h2 em{color:var(--forest)}.contract-intro>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted);max-width:460px}.contract-scope{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--forest-dark);padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.contract-scope>span{width:7px;height:7px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:50%;background:var(--forest)}.contract-picker{padding:0;border:0;margin:12px 0 0;min-width:0}.contract-picker legend{font-size:14px;font-weight:550;margin-bottom:12px;padding:0}.contract-picker>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.contract-picker label{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;min-height:78px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid #a7b29e;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;background:#faf8f1}.contract-picker label:has(input:checked){border-color:var(--forest);background:#e7eddc;box-shadow:inset 0 -3px 0 var(--forest)}.contract-picker input{width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--forest);flex-shrink:0;margin:0}.contract-picker label:has(input:focus-visible){outline:3px solid var(--rust);outline-offset:4px}.contract-picker strong,.contract-picker small{display:block}.contract-picker strong{font-size:16px;font-weight:650}.contract-picker small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}.contract-view{display:none;border:1px solid #a7b29e;margin-top:18px;border-radius:4px;background:#fbfaf4;overflow:hidden}.engine-contract-showcase:has(#contract-claude:checked) [data-engine=claude],.engine-contract-showcase:has(#contract-codex:checked) [data-engine=codex],.engine-contract-showcase:has(#contract-opencode:checked) [data-engine=opencode]{display:block}.contract-view-header{padding:24px 28px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.contract-view-header>p:first-child{font-size:13px;color:var(--forest);margin-bottom:12px}.contract-view-header>p:first-child>span{margin-inline:9px;color:#7c8775}.contract-view-header h3{font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:12px}.contract-view-header>p:last-child{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;color:var(--muted)}.contract-translation{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr}.contract-source{padding:22px 28px;background:#ecefe3;border-right:1px solid #c5cdbb}.contract-column-label{font-size:13px;font-weight:650;color:var(--forest);margin-bottom:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.contract-column-label>span{font-size:12px;font-weight:450;color:var(--muted)}.contract-source ol,.contract-chat ol,.contract-focus ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.contract-source li{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;min-height:90px;border-top:1px solid #c5cdbb;font-size:15px}.contract-source li>span{color:var(--rust);font-size:19px;font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic}.contract-chat{padding:22px 28px}.contract-chat-event{padding:15px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.contract-chat-event>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}.contract-chat-event code{color:var(--forest);font-size:12px;min-width:76px}.contract-chat-event strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:550}.contract-chat-event pre{font:15px/1.6 var(--sans);white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;padding-left:90px;margin:6px 0 0}.contract-tool_use pre,.contract-tool_result pre{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;font-size:13px}.contract-done{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.contract-done pre{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:20px;font-style:italic;color:var(--forest-dark)}.contract-command-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin-top:12px}.contract-focus{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px 36px;padding:26px 28px;border-top:1px solid #c5cdbb;background:#f1f1e6}.contract-focus h4{font:550 25px/1.2 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0 0 10px}.contract-focus>div>p:last-child{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted)}.contract-focus li{display:grid;gap:5px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #c5cdbb;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.contract-focus strong{font-weight:550;color:var(--forest-dark)}.contract-focus li:first-child{padding-top:0;border-top:0}.contract-boundary{font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted);padding:18px 28px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.contract-details{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.contract-details>summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;min-height:52px;padding:14px 28px;font-size:14px;font-weight:550;cursor:pointer}.contract-details[open]>summary :global(.ui-icon){transform:rotate(45deg)}.contract-details>div{padding:0 28px 22px;min-width:0}.contract-details p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px;max-width:940px}.contract-details pre{max-height:360px;overflow:auto;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#f4f3eb;margin:14px 0 0;tab-size:2}.contract-evidence{margin-top:22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.contract-evidence>summary,.contract-evidence>div{padding-inline:8px}.contract-evidence ul{padding:0;list-style:none;margin:12px 0 18px}.contract-evidence li{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 22px;align-items:center;padding:7px 0;font-size:14px}.contract-evidence li>strong{min-width:86px}.contract-evidence code{font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;min-width:0}.contract-evidence a{display:inline-flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;min-height:46px}.engine-contract-showcase :global(.ui-icon){width:18px;height:18px;flex-shrink:0}.engine-contract-showcase :is(summary,a,pre):focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--rust);outline-offset:4px}
@media(max-width:900px){.contract-intro{gap:24px}.contract-picker label{padding:13px;gap:9px}.contract-picker small{font-size:12px}.contract-translation{grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr}.contract-source,.contract-chat{padding:22px}.contract-chat-event>div{gap:8px}.contract-chat-event pre{padding-left:0;margin-top:8px}.contract-chat-event code{min-width:70px}.contract-focus{gap:24px;padding:24px}.contract-source li{min-height:100px}.contract-view-header{padding:24px}}
@media(max-width:650px){.engine-contract-showcase{padding-block:30px 38px}.contract-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}.contract-intro h2{font-size:clamp(2.15rem,8vw,3.2rem)}.contract-intro>p{font-size:16px}.contract-scope{font-size:13px;align-items:baseline}.contract-picker>div{gap:8px}.contract-picker label{padding:12px 8px;gap:7px;min-height:58px;justify-content:center}.contract-picker strong{font-size:14px}.contract-picker small{display:none}.contract-picker input{width:16px;height:16px}.contract-translation{grid-template-columns:1fr}.contract-source{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid #c5cdbb;padding:18px 20px}.contract-source ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px 18px}.contract-source li{min-height:58px;font-size:13px;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:10px}.contract-source li>span{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}.contract-column-label{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px}.contract-chat{padding:20px}.contract-chat-event{padding:14px 0}.contract-chat-event>div{gap:12px}.contract-chat-event pre{padding-left:82px}.contract-chat-event strong{font-size:13px}.contract-focus{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;padding:22px 20px}.contract-focus h4{font-size:24px}.contract-view-header{padding:22px 20px}.contract-view-header h3{font-size:25px}.contract-boundary{padding:18px 20px}.contract-details>summary{padding-inline:20px}.contract-details>div{padding-inline:20px}.contract-evidence>summary,.contract-evidence>div{padding-inline:4px}.contract-details pre{padding:12px;font-size:11px}.contract-evidence li{display:block}.contract-evidence li>code{display:block;margin-top:4px}}
@media(max-width:380px){.contract-picker label{gap:5px;padding-inline:6px}.contract-picker strong{font-size:13px}.contract-chat-event pre{padding-left:0}.contract-intro h2{font-size:2.1rem}.contract-source ol{gap:10px 12px}}
</style>
